{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひかないようにしなければ！北野日奈子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！54回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nにっくさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝からある番組のロケに行った先で\nチョコレートやジュース\nケーキを食べて\nある番組の収録でもケーキやクッキーやおかしをたらふく食べました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエットはじめよう！としたら\nケーキを食べる運命になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何事もタイミングが大切ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後さんも昨日からチョコレート禁止にしてたんだけど、もう今日解禁されてたよ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠ざけようとすればするほど\n気になるし、よってくるものだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のダイエットはいつから始められるのだろ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週刊プレイボーイさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕日が眩しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆さとりょーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁乃木坂に入る前に憧れてたアイドルの方とかいるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎前田敦子さんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆よしさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは着なくなった服とかどーしてますか？僕はクローゼットに入らなくなると弟に押し付けます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎同じく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"押し付け気味だけど、\n可愛いんだけどもう着ないんだよね～\n着る～？着るよね～？\nって押し付けます！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛くてすきで買ったお洋服だから、\n捨てるのはもったいないし。。。って\n思っちゃう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ともちかさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃん！小樽のオススメのお店とかある～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎いろいろあるけど、行ったことなくて\n最近気になってるお店は\n小樽運河近くの小樽キャンドル工房っていうお店！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆マスピィさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁最近、顔が大人になった！\n→そうそう！\n「口づけ」してからそんな感じがする♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎いや、大人への近道のMVの事だろうけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してないです！！！\nよくみて！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆若鷹のほっしーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃん、もうそろそろ春物の服買いたいんやけど、きいちゃんは最近春物の洋服買ったりした？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎春物の服少しだけ買ったよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビスチェ買ったの！\nかわいいよ～！今度また握手会できるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆たうぇいさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃん前みたいに髪短くしたいって思ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎また短くはしようと思ってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、いまはまだしないかな～！\n突然したくなったらするし\n必要になったらします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！\n今日はこれで終わりです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんとマフラー半分こ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  こばさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きぃちゃんの全力のロマいかを生で見たいよ´ω`)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ライブでのパフォーマンスは全力ですよ！特にロマいかははちゃめちゃ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  愛犬の名前はそらさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎明日の終わりの挨拶はこれで行こう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さよなら△また来て□バイバイキーン(^з^)-☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ちょうどヒナセレで挨拶には選べませんでしたー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、挨拶の案のコメントもしてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  イッシーさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎コントは今までのあまり経験無かったと思うけど楽しかったですか？\nまたやってみたいと思いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎メイドコントのことですよね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しかったです♪\nまたやりたいな～٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(212)  すぱろうさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎大人への近道のガォーが可愛すぎて30回くらいリピートした笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そうなんです！実は間奏部分のポーズして後ろ向く振りの時のポーズをがおーにしてるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  夜霧46さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎アンダー武道館のダイジェスト見て改めて思ったんだけど、\n乃木坂の楽曲って、心に響くねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ありがとうごさいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな風に言っていただけるのは\nとても嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、みなさんの心に\n届くような歌を歌っていきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(717)  りゅうへい 三歳のサイ■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎中３でシャトルラン117回って女子で一番だったんじゃない！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎うーん、覚えてないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番ではなかったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(750)  のんちゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃおう！\n紅白スペシャルの大人への近道で｢ガオー！｣って\nやった気がするんだけど気のせいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎気のせいじゃないよ！やってたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次みなさんの前で披露するのは\n13枚目最後の京都全国握手会での\nミニライブでかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時はなにしよう～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれでおわりー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/12/8891398/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n46回目はやっさんさんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『To Be Continued...』"}],"source":"archive"}